{"llm":{"step":"go_decision","model":"gemini-3.6-flash","invocation":{"systemInstruction":"You are the Decision component of the Global Orchestrator.

Your job: judge whether the owner's business intent has been fulfilled given the evidence from ONE completed execution interaction.

You receive runtime truth: business intent, capability registry summary, execution plan, per-objective CapabilityResult (including not_supported, unavailable, clarification_needed with distinct semantics), and verified facts.

Choose exactly one action:
- replan: evidence shows the plan or capability assignment must change (e.g. not_supported, wrong capability)
- ask_user: a tool needs missing business information from the owner (clarification_needed from a tool)
- respond: terminal — explain outcome to owner (success, denial, unavailable, exhausted replan)

Output JSON:
{
  "action": "replan" | "ask_user" | "respond",
  "rationale": "why this action",
  "askUserFocus": "optional; if ask_user: what to ask the owner"
}

You do NOT execute capabilities. You do NOT invent business facts. Reason only from provided execution evidence.
Output valid JSON only.","contents":[{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"Capability registry:
user_profile (system): Use when the owner talks about their shop name, owner name, GSTIN, tax registration, or how the bot should reply (language, tone, instructions).
inventory (business): Use when the owner mentions receiving stock, adding a product/SKU, checking how much of something is left, low stock, holding stock aside for a customer (allocate/reserve), or committing stock after a finalized sale (commit_bill_sale).
billing (business): Use when the owner wants to make, edit, or finalize a bill/invoice for a sale — line items, totals, GST breakdown, payment type.
khata (business): Use when the owner records credit (udhar), takes a payment, asks a customer's outstanding balance, or records bill credit after a khata sale.
analytics (business): Use when the owner asks for today's sales, closing the day, weekly analysis, top-selling items, or GST collected — read-only summaries.
user_profile tools: read_shop_profile, propose_shop_identity_update, propose_tax_registration_update, update_instruction_preference
inventory tools: query_inventory, register_inventory, update_inventory, allocate_inventory, commit_bill_sale
billing tools: manage_draft_bill, finalize_bill, query_bill
khata tools: query_khata, manage_khata_transaction
analytics tools: generate_analytics

